      },
      "Message": {
        "User": {
          "userId": "eid_2d8eff4d",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-23T13:26:00",
          "text": "Thanks for the feedback, everyone! @Ian Davis, I'll add specifics on integration targets. @Julia Smith, I'll expand on user feedback in the adaptive learning section. @Bob Taylor, I'll include a testing strategy section. @Charlie Martinez, I'll break down the pilot phases further. @Alice Jones, I'll outline our marketing strategy in the competitive analysis. Let's aim to have these updates by the end of the week. Any other thoughts? 🤔",
